  "description": "Public professional knowledge site by Dzmitryi Kharlanau covering SAP transformation, SD/MM, MDG, integrations, AMS, enterprise operations and practical agentic AI, with structured datasets, retrieval indexes, agent-skill routing, read-only MCP implementations and explicit trust/discovery surfaces.",
  "languages": ["en"],
  "web": {
